OL,3,GNEWSA'I was a professional singer - but
OL,4,Acancer took my voice box'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLife before 2020 was normal for Tanja
OL,7,FBage, a fit and active working
OL,8,Fmother-of-two. But it was not a global
OL,9,Fpandemic that changed Bage's life that
OL,10,Fyear ` instead a cancer diagnosis that
OL,11,Fstole her voice.
OL,13,FA professional singer and actress,
OL,14,FBage, from Leeds, has spent much of her
OL,15,Fadult life on the stage performing in
OL,16,Ftheatre productions. Her voice was one
OL,17,Fof her greatest assets and a huge part
OL,18,Fof her identity.
OL,20,FSinging remains her passion, but she
OL,21,Fnow performs without a voice box since
OL,22,Fhers was removed during treatment.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
