OL,3,GNEWSA'I was a professional singer - but
OL,4,Acancer took my voice box'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBage had a total laryngectomy, which
OL,7,Falso repositioned her airway, after
OL,8,Fbeing diagnosed with adenoid cystic
OL,9,Fcarcinoma - cancer of the salivary
OL,10,Fglands - six years ago, when she was
OL,11,F38.
